---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)]">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl">The story so far</h1>
    <div class="prose-body mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)]/80">
      <p>
        Replace this with the agency's real story — why it started, what it
        believes about the work, and what kind of clients it's built for.
      </p>
      <p>
        A short paragraph on values or process works well here too, especially
        if it sets up the Services page that follows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
